@startuml Google_Login_System_Sequence_Diagram

title System Sequence Diagram: Google OAuth Login/Registration Function\n(Administrator and Tourist via Google Authentication)

actor "User\n(Tourist/Admin)" as User
participant "UI: Login/Register\nPage" as UI
participant "Google OAuth\nService" as Google
participant "Authentication\nService" as Auth
participant "Database\n(MongoDB)" as DB

== Google Login/Register Flow ==

User -> UI: Click "Sign in with Google"
activate UI

UI -> Google: Initiate Google OAuth
activate Google

Google --> User: Display Google login popup

User -> Google: Select Google account\nand authorize

Google -> Google: Authenticate user

Google --> UI: Return credential token
deactivate Google

UI -> Auth: POST /api/auth/google-login\n{token: credential}
activate Auth

Auth -> Auth: Verify Google token\nwith Google API

alt Token Invalid
    Auth --> UI: Invalid token
    UI --> User: Show error message\n"Google login failed"
else Token Valid
    Auth -> Auth: Extract user info\n(email, name, profile picture)
    
    Auth -> DB: Check if user exists\n(by email)
    activate DB
    
    alt User Already Exists
        DB --> Auth: Return existing user
        deactivate DB
        
        Auth -> Auth: Generate JWT token
        
        Auth --> UI: {user, token}
        deactivate Auth
        
        UI -> UI: Store token and user data\nin localStorage
        
        UI -> UI: Check user role and\nprofile completion
        
        alt User is Admin
            UI --> User: Redirect to Admin Home
        else Profile Incomplete
            UI --> User: Redirect to\nComplete Profile page
        else Profile Complete
            UI --> User: Redirect to Homepage
        end
        
    else New User (First Time)
        DB -> DB: Create new user account\n(auto-activated, no OTP required)
        
        DB -> DB: Store Google profile info\n(name, email, picture)
        
        DB --> Auth: New user created
        deactivate DB
        
        Auth -> Auth: Generate JWT token
        
        Auth --> UI: {user, token}
        deactivate Auth
        
        UI -> UI: Store token and user data\nin localStorage
        
        UI -> UI: Check if admin or tourist
        
        alt User is Admin
            UI --> User: Redirect to Admin Home
        else New Tourist User
            UI --> User: Redirect to\nComplete Profile page\n(add demographics)
        end
    end
end

deactivate UI

note right of User
  **Key Features:**
  • No OTP verification required
  • Account auto-activated for Google users
  • First-time users auto-registered
  • Existing users auto-logged in
  • Google profile info stored (name, email, picture)
  • JWT token generated immediately
  • Profile completion required for tourists
  • Admin users bypass profile completion
  • Secure token verification with Google API
end note

@enduml
